I am the independent Loop C post-result auditor for PR-EXP-07. Method: **packet-only**. I used no tools, read no files, ran no commands, made no network requests, and edited nothing. Every judgment below is derived solely from the supplied packet (prereg v2, `receipt.json`, `result.json`, `stop_event.json`, `swap_invariance_proof.json`, `extraction_proof.json`, `attrition.json`, `pairing_rule.json`, `feature_sets.json`, `frozen_inputs.json`, `implementation_contract.md`). Missing evidence is labelled **UNVERIFIED**, not inferred in the experimenter's favour. Disclosed round incidents (dispatch-layer a1/a2 failures; re-audit log capture loss; Loop D definition defects) are treated as disclosed context, not as part of this experiment's scientific record; where they bear on evidentiary quality I say so explicitly rather than silently absorbing or silently discarding them. I did not participate in preregistration, contract authoring (Loop D), dispatch, or execution. All labels below are FACT (entailed by packet text/arithmetics/hash cross-references), INFERENCE (reasoned conclusion, marked), or UNVERIFIED (not decidable from the packet).

